<title>USA: Kimberly-Clark unveils hook and loop diapers.</title>
<headline>Kimberly-Clark unveils hook and loop diapers.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimberly-Clark Corp said on Tuesday it plans to use adjustable hook-and-loop fasteners on its Huggies Ultratrim diapers in place of tape tabs.</p>
<p>The new diaper will begin shipping this month, the company said.</p>
<p>Kimberly-Clark also said it will reduce package counts on selected sizes of Huggies diapers to match those of a major competitor.</p>
</text>
